WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.069 --> 00:00:06.135
The Homepage screen sets what members see first when they open the Library.

2
00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:14.754
Find an item, then choose the row it belongs in. Here, Featured.

3
00:00:20.884 --> 00:00:22.739
The arrows set its order within the row.

4
00:00:26.126 --> 00:00:28.077
Save homepage, and the app follows.

5
00:00:28.077 --> 00:00:31.590
Featuring changes where something appears, not who can open it.
